Computing means using computer resources to perform work or process data. 🖥️

In AWS, computing includes:
CPU → Processes tasks
RAM → Temporary working memory
Storage → Stores data
Network → Connects to the internet
Simple example

When you run a Python application:

Python App
    ↓
CPU processes the code ⚙️
    ↓
RAM holds working data 🧠
    ↓
Storage saves files 💾

So in EC2 — Elastic Compute Cloud:

Compute = Computer processing power
Elastic = You can increase or decrease resources
Cloud = The computer runs in AWS data centers ☁️

